{"c":[{"id":"b99fccd1ca3e2300","sum":"Chrome: top AXGroup and AXWebArea carry window and page titles, so keep them out of element keys (E8). Chrome and Helium reject AXManualAccessibility (-25205) yet expose web AX; Electron accepts it. Web pages post no AX notification for DOM text changes (E1).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T100848Z-2317db88abe7ef57","text":"Chrome names its top AXGroup after the window title and AXWebArea after the page title; keep both out of element keys or every key moves on a title change (E8).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T100848Z-7a26e801e62c7446","text":"Chrome and Helium reject AXManualAccessibility (-25205) but still expose web AX; Electron apps accept it. Web pages post no AX notification for DOM text, insert or remove changes (E1).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"97fe10de523bdd37","sum":"A background AppKit app posts AX focus notifications only in its key window; fixtures makeKey() (no activation) before makeFirstResponder. KeyType tokenizes without <bos>; Gemma derails, so apps/caret wraps the runtime (BOSRuntime), not packages/.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T100848Z-bac1844f3b887c52","text":"A non-frontmost AppKit app posts AX focus notifications only inside its key window; fixtures call makeKey() (no activation) before makeFirstResponder.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T113723Z-0310b3f1df11a0ac","text":"KeyType tokenizes with add_special=false; Gemma GGUFs need <bos> or output derails. apps/caret wraps the runtime (BOSRuntime) instead of editing packages/.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
